Package: irishTradeMonitor
Title: Irish Trade Monitor Shiny App
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Stephen", "Byrne", email = "byrnes71@tcd.ie", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny app for monitoring detailed Irish goods-trade data from
    Eurostat Comext, including imports and exports, a SITC 1-digit
    contribution-to-growth decomposition, and 5-digit SITC product and partner
    drill-downs. All data comes from the monthly Comext API; annual figures are
    summed from the monthly series. This DESCRIPTION exists to declare package
    dependencies for reproducible installs; the project is run as scripts plus
    a Shiny app, not installed as a library.
License: MIT
